/*
** README for CNet 4.x Utility Sources
** by: Kelly Cochran
** Sat Nov 27 01:30:10 1999
*/

ANSIDetect/
   Simple ANSI detection program originally by Ray Akey, updated for CNet/4
   by me.

Askhost/
   Cheesy host lookup program example source.

CNDomo/
   Preliminary CNet-aware mailing list manager.  GUI is fully usable, but
   core mailer is effectively a smart alias exploder only.

CNet3Lib/
   Link library for CNet/3 development.  Contains all functions from empty.c
   as well as some other useful ones.

CNet4Lib/
   Link library for CNet/4 development.  Contains all functions from empty.c
   from pre-cnetc.library days as well as some other useful ones.

CNetCGILib/
   Link library for basic CGI functions.

CNetFingerd/
   CNet aware finger daemon.

CNetFingerd-CGI/
   CGI based finger lookup

CNetUptime/
   Utility to display CNet's uptime

ConfigVDE/
   Slightly out of date VDE for editing Config variables.

Daemon/
   Really cheesy test code for internet daemons.

DebugTools/
   Debug utilities.

DirMake/
   Util to remake subboard and data dirs.

DU/
   CLI based dump command. Useful for scripts.

Feedback/
   CNetC based feedback enhancer.

FIDFix/
   Aborted File_ID.DIZ reprocessor.  Almost works.. just doesn't stick the _Short
   data back in the archive..

Finger/
   CNetC finger replacement that is internet aware.. doesn't totally work well.

FunDisplay/
   Quip display program.

FunNum/
   Quip pref program.

IdentdList/
   CLI based program to list CNet's indentd assigned ports.

ItemEdit/
   Preliminary GUI based Item editor.

LT/
   Aborted last callers program.

MAddr/
   List a whole slew of mail addresses and other useful information for users.

NukeAccount/
   Really clear out a deleted account.

OLM/
   CLI based OLM sending programs (CNet/3 and CNet/4)

POP3d/
   POP3 mail daemon for CNet/4.50+

SendMail/
   CLI based mail sending program for CNet/4.50+

ShortWho/
   Quick who for online use (CNetC)

Snapshit/
   Dump last 10 commands on all ports.

Sub4Compact/
   Prelimiary subboards4 compactor.

Sub4Wipe/
   Really kill off deleted subboards.

UL-CGI/
   CGI based Userlister

UPacker/
   Repack bbs.udata4.

UserNote/
   Drop users a note for their next logon.

UUCP_Clean/
   Cleanup orphaned UUCP mail directories

Who-CGI/
   CGI based WHO program.

Who-CLI/
   CLI based who program

Who-Telnet/
   WHO suitable for inetd launch.

WhoSys/
   Short sysop who.

YQ/
   CLI based Yank Queue monitor.
